{"code":"ru","name":"Russian","native":"Русский","phase":1,"medium":"en","file_level":"B1","level":{"title":"Intermediate: motion verbs, dative, opinions","goals":["Use motion verbs and aspects correctly","Use dative for liking, age and giving","Argue opinions and talk weather and plans"],"units":[{"id":"B1-U1","title":"Motion and aspects","lessons":[{"id":"B1-U1-L1","title":"Motion: идти vs ходить","learn":"Russian splits GOING in two! ИДТИ = going right now (one way); ХОДИТЬ = go regularly/there-and-back. Same for riding: ЕХАТЬ (now) vs ЕЗДИТЬ (usually). Я ИДУ = I'm going; Я ХОЖУ = I go (habitually)!","vocab":[{"t":"идти","r":"ee-TEE","en":"to go (now, on foot)","pos":"verb"},{"t":"ходить","r":"khah-DEETY","en":"to go (regularly, on foot)","pos":"verb"},{"t":"ехать","r":"YEH-khahty","en":"to go (now, by transport)","pos":"verb"},{"t":"ездить","r":"YEHZ-deety","en":"to go (regularly, by transport)","pos":"verb"},{"t":"пешком","r":"pih-SHKOHM","en":"on foot","pos":"adverb"},{"t":"на машине","r":"nah mah-SHIH-nyeh","en":"by car","pos":"phrase"},{"t":"туда","r":"too-DAH","en":"there (going)","pos":"adverb"},{"t":"обратно","r":"ah-BRAHT-nah","en":"back","pos":"adverb"}],"grammar":{"title":"One-way vs habitual motion","explain":"ИДТИ/ЕХАТЬ = right now, one direction: Я ИДУ В ШКОЛУ (I'm going). ХОДИТЬ/ЕЗДИТЬ = habits and round trips: Я ХОЖУ В ШКОЛУ (I go/attend). КУДА ТЫ ИДЁШЬ? = Where are you going (now)?","pattern":"идти/ехать (now) · ходить/ездить (usually)","examples":[{"t":"Я иду в школу.","r":"yah ee-DOO f SHKOH-loo.","en":"I'm going to school. (now)"},{"t":"Я хожу в школу.","r":"yah khah-ZHOO f SHKOH-loo.","en":"I go to school. (I attend)"},{"t":"Он ездит на работу на машине.","r":"ohn YEHZ-deet nah rah-BOH-too nah mah-SHIH-nyeh.","en":"He drives to work. (habit)"}],"mistakes":["Saying Я ХОЖУ for right-now — now = Я ИДУ!","Saying Я ЕДУ for habits — habits = Я ЕЗЖУ!"]},"dialogue":[{"sp":"Анна","t":"Куда ты идёшь?","r":"koo-DAH tih ee-DYOHSH?","en":"Where are you going? (now)"},{"sp":"Иван","t":"Я иду в школу пешком.","r":"yah ee-DOO f SHKOH-loo pih-SHKOHM.","en":"I'm walking to school."},{"sp":"Анна","t":"А я езжу на работу на машине.","r":"ah yah YEHS-jhoo nah rah-BOH-too nah mah-SHIH-nyeh.","en":"And I drive to work. (habit)"},{"sp":"Иван","t":"Понятно!","r":"pah-NYAHT-nah!","en":"Got it!"}],"practice":[{"type":"translate_en","q":"Say: I'm going to school (now)","answer":"Я иду в школу"},{"type":"fill","q":"Я ___ в школу. (attend, habit)","answer":"хожу"},{"type":"choose","q":"'He drives to work (habit)' is…","options":["Он едет на работу","Он ездит на работу","Он идёт на работу","Он ходит на работу пешком"],"answer":"Он ездит на работу"},{"type":"reorder","q":"Order: школу / иду / в / я","answer":"я иду в школу"},{"type":"speak","q":"Say aloud: Куда ты идёшь?","answer":"Куда ты идёшь?"}],"quiz":[{"q":"Я ИДУ means…","options":["I go (habit)","I'm going (now)","I went","I will go"],"answer":1,"why":"Идти = one-way now."},{"q":"Я ХОЖУ means…","options":["I'm going now","I go regularly","I went once","I drive"],"answer":1,"why":"Ходить = habitual/round-trip."},{"q":"ЕЗДИТЬ is for…","options":["walking now","transport habits","flying once","swimming"],"answer":1,"why":"Ездить = go-by-transport usually."},{"q":"ПЕШКОМ means…","options":["by car","on foot","by bus","quickly"],"answer":1,"why":"Пешком = on foot."},{"q":"КУДА ТЫ ИДЁШЬ? asks…","options":["where do you live","where going now","where were you","how do you go"],"answer":1,"why":"Куда + идёшь = going where now."}],"flashcards":"auto:vocab","worksheet":{"title":"Motion verbs worksheet","tasks":[{"instruction":"Translate to Russian.","items":["to go (now, on foot)","on foot","back"],"key":["идти","пешком","обратно"]},{"instruction":"Идти or ходить?","items":["I'm going (now) → я …","I attend (habit) → я …","He drives (habit) → он …"],"key":["иду","хожу","ездит"]},{"instruction":"Ask and answer.","items":["Where are you going? (now)","I'm walking to school"],"key":["Куда ты идёшь?","Я иду в школу пешком"]}]}},{"id":"B1-U1-L2","title":"Aspect: читал vs прочитал","learn":"Two verbs for one idea! ЧИТАТЬ = to read (process); ПРОЧИТАТЬ = to read (finish it!). Past: Я ЧИТАЛ = I was reading; Я ПРОЧИТАЛ = I read (done!). Prefixes finish actions: ДЕЛАТЬ→СДЕЛАТЬ, ПИСАТЬ→НАПИСÁТЬ!","vocab":[{"t":"делать","r":"DYEH-lahty","en":"to do (process)","pos":"verb"},{"t":"сделать","r":"ZDYEH-lahty","en":"to do (complete)","pos":"verb"},{"t":"читать","r":"chee-TAHTY","en":"to read (process)","pos":"verb"},{"t":"прочитать","r":"prah-chee-TAHTY","en":"to read (finish)","pos":"verb"},{"t":"писать","r":"pee-SAHTY","en":"to write (process)","pos":"verb"},{"t":"написать","r":"nah-pee-SAHTY","en":"to write (finish)","pos":"verb"},{"t":"есть","r":"yehsty","en":"to eat","pos":"verb"},{"t":"съесть","r":"syehsty","en":"to eat up","pos":"verb"}],"grammar":{"title":"Aspect pairs: process vs result","explain":"Imperfective = process (Я ЧИТАЛ = I was reading). Perfective = result (Я ПРОЧИТАЛ = I finished it). Past perfective looks the same: ПРОЧИТАЛ/ПРОЧИТАЛА. Ask: finished? → perfective!","pattern":"читал (was -ing) · прочитал (finished)","examples":[{"t":"Я читал книгу.","r":"yah chee-TAHL KNEE-goo.","en":"I was reading a book."},{"t":"Я прочитал книгу.","r":"yah prah-chee-TAHL KNEE-goo.","en":"I read (finished) the book."},{"t":"Ты сделал уроки?","r":"tih ZDYEH-lah-oo-ROH-kee?","en":"Did you finish your homework?"}],"mistakes":["Using ЧИТАЛ for finished books — finished = ПРОЧИТАЛ!","Using perfective in present — perfective has no present!"]},"dialogue":[{"sp":"Иван","t":"Ты прочитал книгу?","r":"tih prah-chee-TAHL KNEE-goo?","en":"Did you finish the book?"},{"sp":"Анна","t":"Да! Я прочитала её вчера.","r":"dah! yah prah-chee-TAH-lah yih-YOH fchih-RAH.","en":"Yes! I finished it yesterday."},{"sp":"Иван","t":"А я читал, но не закончил.","r":"ah yah chee-TAHL, noh nyeh zah-KOHN-cheel.","en":"And I was reading, but didn't finish."},{"sp":"Анна","t":"Ничего!","r":"nee-chih-VOH!","en":"No problem!"}],"practice":[{"type":"translate_en","q":"Say: I finished the book","answer":"Я прочитал книгу"},{"type":"fill","q":"Ты ___ уроки? (finished)","answer":"сделал"},{"type":"choose","q":"'I was reading' is…","options":["Я прочитал","Я читал","Я читаю","Я буду читать"],"answer":"Я читал"},{"type":"reorder","q":"Order: прочитал / книгу / я","answer":"я прочитал книгу"},{"type":"speak","q":"Say aloud: Ты прочитал книгу?","answer":"Ты прочитал книгу?"}],"quiz":[{"q":"Я ПРОЧИТАЛ means…","options":["I was reading","I finished reading","I will read","I like reading"],"answer":1,"why":"Perfective = completed."},{"q":"Я ЧИТАЛ means…","options":["I finished","I was reading","I will read","I must read"],"answer":1,"why":"Imperfective = process."},{"q":"СДЕЛАТЬ is…","options":["to do (process)","to do (complete)","to undo","to redo"],"answer":1,"why":"С- prefix completes ДЕЛАТЬ."},{"q":"Finished? → use…","options":["imperfective","perfective","future","infinitive"],"answer":1,"why":"Result = perfective."},{"q":"Perfective verbs have…","options":["a present tense","no present tense","no past","no future"],"answer":1,"why":"Perfective future = ПРОЧИТАЮ (will finish)."}],"flashcards":"auto:vocab","worksheet":{"title":"Aspect worksheet","tasks":[{"instruction":"Translate to Russian.","items":["to read (finish)","to write (finish)","to do (complete)"],"key":["прочитать","написать","сделать"]},{"instruction":"Process or result?","items":["I was reading → я …","I finished the book → я …","Did you finish homework? → ты …?"],"key":["читал","прочитал книгу","сделал уроки"]},{"instruction":"Book chat.","items":["Did you finish the book?","Yes! I finished it yesterday"],"key":["Ты прочитал книгу?","Да! Я прочитала её вчера"]}]}}]},{"id":"B1-U2","title":"Dative and people","lessons":[{"id":"B1-U2-L1","title":"Dative: мне нравится","learn":"LIKES flip too! МНЕ НРАВИТСЯ = To-me it-pleases = I like it. Dative pronouns: МНЕ, ТЕБЕ, ЕМУ, ЕЙ, НАМ, ВАМ, ИМ. ДАЙ МНЕ = Give me. Russians give everything TO people!","vocab":[{"t":"мне","r":"mnyeh","en":"to me","pos":"pronoun"},{"t":"тебе","r":"tih-BYEH","en":"to you (informal)","pos":"pronoun"},{"t":"ему","r":"yeh-MOO","en":"to him","pos":"pronoun"},{"t":"ей","r":"yehy","en":"to her","pos":"pronoun"},{"t":"нам","r":"nahm","en":"to us","pos":"pronoun"},{"t":"вам","r":"vahm","en":"to you (formal)","pos":"pronoun"},{"t":"им","r":"eem","en":"to them","pos":"pronoun"},{"t":"нравиться","r":"NRAH-veet-syah","en":"to be pleasing","pos":"verb"}],"grammar":{"title":"Мне нравится = I like","explain":"МНЕ НРАВИТСЯ КНИГА = I like the book (to-me pleases the-book). Plural: МНЕ НРАВЯТСЯ КНИГИ. The THING is the subject — it pleases you!","pattern":"мне/тебе/ему + нравится/нравятся","examples":[{"t":"Мне нравится книга.","r":"mnyeh NRAH-veet-syah KNEE-gah.","en":"I like the book."},{"t":"Мне нравятся книги.","r":"mnyeh NRAH-vyaht-syah KNEE-gee.","en":"I like books."},{"t":"Тебе нравится Москва?","r":"tih-BYEH NRAH-veet-syah mahsk-VAH?","en":"Do you like Moscow?"}],"mistakes":["Saying Я НРАВЛЮ — never! МНЕ НРАВИТСЯ!","Forgetting plural: КНИГИ → НРАВЯТСЯ."]},"dialogue":[{"sp":"Анна","t":"Тебе нравится Москва?","r":"tih-BYEH NRAH-veet-syah mahsk-VAH?","en":"Do you like Moscow?"},{"sp":"Иван","t":"Да, мне очень нравится!","r":"dah, mnyeh OH-chihny NRAH-veet-syah!","en":"Yes, I like it a lot!"},{"sp":"Анна","t":"Мне нравятся парки.","r":"mnyeh NRAH-vyaht-syah PAHR-kee.","en":"I like the parks."},{"sp":"Иван","t":"И мне тоже!","r":"ee mnyeh TOH-zhih!","en":"Me too!"}],"practice":[{"type":"translate_en","q":"Say: I like the book","answer":"Мне нравится книга"},{"type":"fill","q":"Мне ___ книги. (plural like)","answer":"нравятся"},{"type":"choose","q":"'Do you like Moscow?' is…","options":["Ты любишь Москва?","Тебе нравится Москва?","Ты нравишь Москву?","Тебе любит Москва?"],"answer":"Тебе нравится Москва?"},{"type":"reorder","q":"Order: нравится / книга / мне","answer":"мне нравится книга"},{"type":"speak","q":"Say aloud: Мне очень нравится!","answer":"Мне очень нравится!"}],"quiz":[{"q":"МНЕ НРАВИТСЯ КНИГА means…","options":["I read the book","I like the book","I want the book","I see the book"],"answer":1,"why":"To-me pleases = I like."},{"q":"Plural THING needs…","options":["нравится","нравятся","нравлюсь","нравимся"],"answer":1,"why":"Книги → нравЯТСЯ."},{"q":"ЕЙ means…","options":["to him","to her","to us","to them"],"answer":1,"why":"Ей = to her."},{"q":"ДАЙ МНЕ means…","options":["tell me","give me","show me","help me"],"answer":1,"why":"Дай + мне = give me."},{"q":"The SUBJECT of НРАВИТСЯ is…","options":["the person","the thing liked","nobody","always я"],"answer":1,"why":"The book pleases me!"}],"flashcards":"auto:vocab","worksheet":{"title":"Dative likes worksheet","tasks":[{"instruction":"Translate to Russian.","items":["to me","to us","to them"],"key":["мне","нам","им"]},{"instruction":"Like things.","items":["I like the book","I like books","Do you like Moscow?"],"key":["Мне нравится книга","Мне нравятся книги","Тебе нравится Москва?"]},{"instruction":"Agree.","items":["Yes, I like it a lot!","Me too!"],"key":["Да, мне очень нравится!","И мне тоже!"]}]}},{"id":"B1-U2-L2","title":"Age and family: мне 20 лет","learn":"Age is dative too! МНЕ 20 ЛЕТ = To-me 20 years = I'm 20. 1 ГОД, 2–4 ГОДА, 5+ ЛЕТ. Family: МОЙ БРАТ (my brother), МОЯ СЕСТРА (my sister) — МОЙ changes gender!","vocab":[{"t":"семья","r":"sihm-YAH","en":"family","pos":"noun"},{"t":"брат","r":"braht","en":"brother","pos":"noun"},{"t":"сестра","r":"sihst-RAH","en":"sister","pos":"noun"},{"t":"родители","r":"rah-dee-TYEH-lee","en":"parents","pos":"noun"},{"t":"сын","r":"sihn","en":"son","pos":"noun"},{"t":"дочь","r":"dohchy","en":"daughter","pos":"noun"},{"t":"муж","r":"moosh","en":"husband","pos":"noun"},{"t":"жена","r":"zhih-NAH","en":"wife","pos":"noun"}],"grammar":{"title":"Мне 20 лет + мой/моя/моё","explain":"МНЕ 21 ГОД, МНЕ 23 ГОДА, МНЕ 25 ЛЕТ. МОЙ БРАТ (m), МОЯ СЕСТРА (f), МОЁ ОКНО (n), МОИ РОДИТЕЛИ (pl). Possessives match the OWNED thing!","pattern":"мне + number + год/года/лет · мой/моя/моё","examples":[{"t":"Мне двадцать лет.","r":"mnyeh DVAHT-tsahty lyeht.","en":"I'm twenty."},{"t":"Мой брат живёт в Москве.","r":"moy braht zhih-VYOHT v mahsk-VYEH.","en":"My brother lives in Moscow."},{"t":"Моя сестра студентка.","r":"mah-YAH sihst-RAH stoo-DYEHNT-kah.","en":"My sister is a student."}],"mistakes":["Saying Я 20 ЛЕТ — age needs МНЕ!","Saying МОЙ СЕСТРА — sister needs МОЯ!"]},"dialogue":[{"sp":"Иван","t":"Сколько тебе лет?","r":"SKOHL-kah tih-BYEH lyeht?","en":"How old are you?"},{"sp":"Анна","t":"Мне двадцать лет. А тебе?","r":"mnyeh DVAHT-tsahty lyeht. ah tih-BYEH?","en":"I'm twenty. And you?"},{"sp":"Иван","t":"Мне двадцать пять. Моя семья большая!","r":"mnyeh DVAHT-tsahty pyahty. mah-YAH sihm-YAH bahl-SHAH-yah!","en":"I'm twenty-five. My family is big!"},{"sp":"Анна","t":"Здорово!","r":"zdah-ROH-vah!","en":"Great!"}],"practice":[{"type":"translate_en","q":"Say: I'm twenty","answer":"Мне двадцать лет"},{"type":"fill","q":"___ сестра студентка. (My, f)","answer":"Моя"},{"type":"choose","q":"'How old are you?' is…","options":["Сколько тебе лет?","Какой тебе год?","Сколько ты лет?","Что тебе лет?"],"answer":"Сколько тебе лет?"},{"type":"reorder","q":"Order: двадцать / мне / лет","answer":"мне двадцать лет"},{"type":"speak","q":"Say aloud: Мне двадцать лет.","answer":"Мне двадцать лет."}],"quiz":[{"q":"МНЕ 20 ЛЕТ means…","options":["I want 20","I'm 20","I see 20","I have 20"],"answer":1,"why":"To-me 20 years = I'm 20."},{"q":"МОЯ is for…","options":["masculine","feminine","neuter","plural"],"answer":1,"why":"МОЯ СЕСТРА."},{"q":"21 takes…","options":["лет","года","год","лети"],"answer":2,"why":"1 → ГОД: 21 год."},{"q":"ДОЧЬ means…","options":["son","daughter","wife","sister"],"answer":1,"why":"Дочь = daughter."},{"q":"МОИ is for…","options":["one masculine","one feminine","plural","neuter only"],"answer":2,"why":"МОИ РОДИТЕЛИ."}],"flashcards":"auto:vocab","worksheet":{"title":"Age and family worksheet","tasks":[{"instruction":"Translate to Russian.","items":["family","brother","daughter"],"key":["семья","брат","дочь"]},{"instruction":"Say ages.","items":["I'm twenty","How old are you?"],"key":["Мне двадцать лет","Сколько тебе лет?"]},{"instruction":"Match мой.","items":["my brother","my sister","my parents"],"key":["мой брат","моя сестра","мои родители"]}]}}]},{"id":"B1-U3","title":"Opinions and plans","lessons":[{"id":"B1-U3-L1","title":"Opinions and comparisons","learn":"Argue in Russian! Я ДУМАЮ, ЧТО… (I think that…), ЛУЧШЕ (better), ХУЖЕ (worse), БОЛЬШЕ (bigger/more), САМЫЙ (most): САМЫЙ ЛУЧШИЙ = the best!","vocab":[{"t":"думать","r":"DOO-mahty","en":"to think","pos":"verb"},{"t":"считать","r":"shchee-TAHTY","en":"to consider","pos":"verb"},{"t":"лучше","r":"LOOCH-shih","en":"better","pos":"adverb"},{"t":"хуже","r":"KHOO-zhih","en":"worse","pos":"adverb"},{"t":"больше","r":"BOHL-shih","en":"bigger / more","pos":"adverb"},{"t":"меньше","r":"MYEHNY-shih","en":"smaller / less","pos":"adverb"},{"t":"самый","r":"SAH-mihy","en":"the most","pos":"adjective"},{"t":"такой","r":"tah-KOY","en":"such / so","pos":"adjective"}],"grammar":{"title":"Думаю что + лучше/хуже","explain":"Я ДУМАЮ, ЧТО МОСКВА БОЛЬШЕ = I think Moscow is bigger. Comparatives never change: ЛУЧШЕ, ХУЖЕ, БОЛЬШЕ. САМЫЙ + adjective = superlative: САМЫЙ КРАСИВЫЙ = the most beautiful!","pattern":"думаю, что + comparative · самый + adj","examples":[{"t":"Я думаю, что это лучше.","r":"yah DOO-mah-yoo, shtoh EH-tah LOOCH-shih.","en":"I think this is better."},{"t":"Москва больше.","r":"mahsk-VAH BOHL-shih.","en":"Moscow is bigger."},{"t":"Самый лучший день!","r":"SAH-mihy LOOCH-shihy dyehny!","en":"The best day!"}],"mistakes":["Changing ЛУЧШЕ by gender — comparatives never change!","Forgetting ЧТО after ДУМАЮ: ДУМАЮ, ЧТО…"]},"dialogue":[{"sp":"Анна","t":"Я думаю, что метро лучше.","r":"yah DOO-mah-yoo, shtoh miht-ROH LOOCH-shih.","en":"I think the metro is better."},{"sp":"Иван","t":"А я считаю, что машина быстрее.","r":"ah yah shchee-TAH-yoo, shtoh mah-SHIH-nah bihst-RYEH-yeh.","en":"And I consider the car faster."},{"sp":"Анна","t":"Но метро дешевле!","r":"noh miht-ROH dih-SHEHV-lyeh!","en":"But the metro is cheaper!"},{"sp":"Иван","t":"Согласен!","r":"sahg-LAH-sihn!","en":"Agreed!"}],"practice":[{"type":"translate_en","q":"Say: I think this is better","answer":"Я думаю, что это лучше"},{"type":"fill","q":"Самый ___ день! (best)","answer":"лучший"},{"type":"choose","q":"'Moscow is bigger' is…","options":["Москва большой","Москва больше","Москва самая большая","Москва более большая"],"answer":"Москва больше"},{"type":"reorder","q":"Order: думаю / что / я / лучше / это","answer":"я думаю что это лучше"},{"type":"speak","q":"Say aloud: Я думаю, что метро лучше.","answer":"Я думаю, что метро лучше."}],"quiz":[{"q":"Я ДУМАЮ, ЧТО means…","options":["I know that","I think that","I see that","I want that"],"answer":1,"why":"Думаю, что = I think that."},{"q":"ХУЖЕ means…","options":["better","worse","bigger","smaller"],"answer":1,"why":"Хуже = worse."},{"q":"САМЫЙ ЛУЧШИЙ means…","options":["very good","the best","better","good day"],"answer":1,"why":"Самый + adj = superlative."},{"q":"Comparatives like ЛУЧШЕ…","options":["change gender","never change","add -ы","need cases"],"answer":1,"why":"Лучше/хуже/больше are frozen."},{"q":"СОГЛАСЕН means…","options":["disagree","agreed","maybe","never"],"answer":1,"why":"Согласен = agreed (m)."}],"flashcards":"auto:vocab","worksheet":{"title":"Opinions worksheet","tasks":[{"instruction":"Translate to Russian.","items":["to think","better","the most"],"key":["думать","лучше","самый"]},{"instruction":"Compare.","items":["I think this is better","Moscow is bigger","The best day!"],"key":["Я думаю, что это лучше","Москва больше","Самый лучший день!"]},{"instruction":"Debate.","items":["I think the metro is better","Agreed!"],"key":["Я думаю, что метро лучше","Согласен!"]}]}},{"id":"B1-U3-L2","title":"Weather and plans","learn":"Russian weather talk! ИДЁТ ДОЖДЬ (it's raining), ИДЁТ СНЕГ (it's snowing), ХОЛОДНО (it's cold), ЖАРКО (it's hot). No subject — weather just HAPPENS. Plus future plans with БУДУ!","vocab":[{"t":"погода","r":"pah-GOH-dah","en":"weather","pos":"noun"},{"t":"солнце","r":"SOHLN-tsih","en":"sun","pos":"noun"},{"t":"дождь","r":"dohshty","en":"rain","pos":"noun"},{"t":"снег","r":"snyehk","en":"snow","pos":"noun"},{"t":"холодно","r":"khah-LOHD-nah","en":"it is cold","pos":"adverb"},{"t":"жарко","r":"ZHAHR-kah","en":"it is hot","pos":"adverb"},{"t":"тепло","r":"tihp-LOH","en":"it is warm","pos":"adverb"},{"t":"ветер","r":"VYEH-tyehr","en":"wind","pos":"noun"}],"grammar":{"title":"Weather without subjects","explain":"ИДЁТ ДОЖДЬ = rain goes = it's raining. ХОЛОДНО = (it is) cold. No ОН/ОНА — just the word! Combine with plans: ЗАВТРА БУДЕТ ТЕПЛО = Tomorrow will be warm.","pattern":"идёт дождь/снег · холодно/жарко/тепло","examples":[{"t":"Сегодня холодно.","r":"sih-VOHD-nyah khah-LOHD-nah.","en":"Today is cold."},{"t":"Идёт дождь.","r":"ee-DYOHT dohshty.","en":"It's raining."},{"t":"Завтра будет тепло.","r":"ZAHF-trah BOO-dih-tyehp-LOH.","en":"Tomorrow will be warm."}],"mistakes":["Saying ОНО ХОЛОДНО — no subject in weather!","Saying ЕСТЬ ДОЖДЬ — rain ИДЁТ (goes)!"]},"dialogue":[{"sp":"Иван","t":"Какая сегодня погода?","r":"kah-KAH-yah sih-VOHD-nyah pah-GOH-dah?","en":"How is the weather today?"},{"sp":"Анна","t":"Холодно! Идёт снег.","r":"khah-LOHD-nah! ee-DYOHT snyehk.","en":"It's cold! It's snowing."},{"sp":"Иван","t":"А завтра будет тепло?","r":"ah ZAHF-trah BOO-dih-tyehp-LOH?","en":"And will it be warm tomorrow?"},{"sp":"Анна","t":"Да! Пойдём гулять!","r":"dah! poy-DYOHM goo-LYAHTY!","en":"Yes! Let's go for a walk!"}],"practice":[{"type":"translate_en","q":"Say: It's raining","answer":"Идёт дождь"},{"type":"fill","q":"Сегодня ___. (cold)","answer":"холодно"},{"type":"choose","q":"'How is the weather today?' is…","options":["Что погода сегодня?","Какая сегодня погода?","Где погода сегодня?","Какая погода вчера?"],"answer":"Какая сегодня погода?"},{"type":"reorder","q":"Order: дождь / идёт","answer":"идёт дождь"},{"type":"speak","q":"Say aloud: Холодно! Идёт снег.","answer":"Холодно! Идёт снег."}],"quiz":[{"q":"ИДЁТ ДОЖДЬ means…","options":["rain falls","it's raining","rain stops","rain dances"],"answer":1,"why":"Идёт дождь = it's raining."},{"q":"ХОЛОДНО means…","options":["it is hot","it is cold","it is warm","it is windy"],"answer":1,"why":"Холодно = cold."},{"q":"ЗАВТРА БУДЕТ ТЕПЛО means…","options":["today is warm","tomorrow will be warm","yesterday was warm","always warm"],"answer":1,"why":"Будет тепло = will be warm."},{"q":"Weather sentences have…","options":["он subject","no subject","она subject","они subject"],"answer":1,"why":"Холодно. Идёт снег. — bare!"},{"q":"СНЕГ means…","options":["rain","snow","wind","sun"],"answer":1,"why":"Снег = snow."}],"flashcards":"auto:vocab","worksheet":{"title":"Weather worksheet","tasks":[{"instruction":"Translate to Russian.","items":["weather","snow","it is cold"],"key":["погода","снег","холодно"]},{"instruction":"Report weather.","items":["It's raining","Today is cold","Tomorrow will be warm"],"key":["Идёт дождь","Сегодня холодно","Завтра будет тепло"]},{"instruction":"Ask and plan.","items":["How is the weather today?","Let's go for a walk!"],"key":["Какая сегодня погода?","Пойдём гулять!"]}]}}]}],"test":{"title":"B1 final test","items":[{"type":"translate_en","q":"Say: I'm going to school (now)","answer":"Я иду в школу"},{"type":"translate_en","q":"Say: I finished the book","answer":"Я прочитал книгу"},{"type":"choose","q":"'I like the book'","options":["Я люблю книгу","Мне нравится книга","Я нравлюсь книге","Меня любит книга"],"answer":"Мне нравится книга"},{"type":"translate_t","q":"Мне двадцать лет.","answer":"I'm twenty."},{"type":"fill","q":"Я ___ в школу. (attend, habit)","answer":"хожу"},{"type":"choose","q":"'I was reading'","options":["Я прочитал","Я читал","Я читаю","Я буду читать"],"answer":"Я читал"},{"type":"reorder","q":"Order: дождь / идёт","answer":"идёт дождь"},{"type":"speak","q":"Say aloud: Я думаю, что метро лучше.","answer":"Я думаю, что метро лучше."},{"type":"fill","q":"Мне ___ книги. (plural like)","answer":"нравятся"},{"type":"translate_en","q":"Say: It's raining","answer":"Идёт дождь"}]}}}